  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> You must be utilizing Mountain King Style</p><p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1 Focus</p><p>The ground shifts beneath your feet to bring your enemies to you.</p><p>As <strong>Free Action</strong> on your turn, you may spend <strong>-1 Focus</strong>. Until the start of your next turn, any enemy within <strong>5 Spaces</strong> of you treats all movement away from you as <strong>Difficult Terrain</strong>.</p><p><strong>Enhancement.</strong> You may use an <strong>Action</strong> when you activate this ability to force all enemies to make a <strong>Resilience Check</strong> opposed by your <strong>Body (Melee Weapons)</strong> or <strong>Body (Ranged Weapons)</strong>, or be forcefully moved up to <strong>5 Spaces</strong> closer to you. If you have <strong><em>Channel the Stone</em></strong>, you may use <strong>Mind</strong> in place of <strong>Body</strong>.</p>",
